# Cursor Rules

Keep project guidance in `.cursor/rules/` as `.mdc` files.

## Location

- Put rule files in `PROJECT_ROOT/.cursor/rules/`
- Don’t place rule files elsewhere

## Naming

- Use kebab-case filenames
- Always use `.mdc`
- Keep names descriptive

## Rule format

Each rule should include YAML frontmatter:

```md
---
description: Short description of the rule's purpose
globs: optional/path/pattern/**/* # optional
alwaysApply: false
---
# Rule Title

Main content explaining the rule with markdown formatting.
```
